· what your hobby is and how long you have been doing it;
· how much time a week you give to your hobby and why;
· what your attitude to creative hobbies is.
You have to talk continuously.

Task 3. You are going to give a talk about reading books. You will have to start in 1.5 minutes and speak for not more than 2 minutes (10 – 12 sentences). Remember to say:
